## Tables

| Table | What is stored | Written by |
|-------|----------------|------------|
| `mst_deposit_account` | Account master: application, scheme, holders, branch / FO, status, closing, full account no | Add / Edit / Status / Close |
| `mst_deposit_account_td` | TD details: start date, period, rate, installments, amount, maturity date / amount, interest, maturity instruction, balance | Add / Edit (`td` block) |
| `trans_rd_schedule` | One row per installment of a **Daily / Recurring** deposit, with paid amount / date and days overdue | Automatic (after TD save and every posted deposit) |
| `trans_mis_payout` | One row per interest payout of a **Monthly Income Scheme**, with paid date and voucher | Built automatically; paid with `TermDepositPayoutPay` |
| `trans_savings_transaction` | Deposits (principal / installments) and the maturity withdrawal | `td.collect_deposit` here; others via [SavingsTransaction](SavingsTransaction.md) |
| `trans_vouchers` / `trans_voucher_details` | Receipt voucher of each deposit, Payment voucher of each MIS payout | Automatic |
| `mst_deposit_account_nominee` / `mst_deposit_account_signatory` | Nominees / signatories | [DepositNominee](DepositNominee.md) / [DepositSignatory](DepositSignatory.md) |

## Endpoints

| # | Endpoint | Method | Use |
|---|----------|--------|-----|
| 1 | `/DepositProductSchemeList?deposit_type_cd=2` | `GET` | TD product types (group 6) with their schemes |
| 2 | `/DepositAccountList?deposit_type_cd=2` | `GET` | TD account list (paginated, filters) |
| 3 | `/DepositAccountView` | `GET` | TD account details incl. schedule / payouts |
| 4 | `/DepositAccountAdd` | `POST` | Open a TD account (+ TD details + first deposit) |
| 5 | `/DepositAccountEdit` | `POST` | Edit account / TD details |
| 6 | `/DepositAccountStatus` | `POST` | Activate / Deactivate / other status |
| 7 | `/DepositAccountClose` | `POST` | Close the account (zero balance) |
| 8 | `/TermDepositScheduleList` | `GET` | Installment schedule of a Daily / Recurring deposit |
| 9 | `/TermDepositScheduleSync` | `POST` | Rebuild the schedule / payouts of an account |
| 10 | `/TermDepositPayoutList` | `GET` | MIS payouts (one account or all, paginated) |
| 11 | `/TermDepositPayoutPay` | `POST` | Pay one MIS payout (+ Payment voucher) |

Deposits into a TD and the maturity withdrawal use [SavingsTransaction](SavingsTransaction.md) (`POST /api/SavingsTransactionAdd`).

Every response uses the standard envelope `{ "success": true, "message": "…", "data": … }`. Paginated lists also return `meta`: `{ "total", "page", "per_page", "last_page", "has_more" }`. Errors look like `{ "success": false, "message": "…" }`; validation errors (`422`) add `errors: { "td.inst_amount": ["…"] }`.

