## Product types at a glance

| `prod_type_cd` | Product | Deposits | Schedule | Maturity amount |
|----------------|---------|----------|----------|-----------------|
| `1` | Daily Deposit | `inst_no` × `inst_amount` (default = term days) | `trans_rd_schedule`, due dates spread evenly over the term | Each deposit earns interest for its remaining time |
| `2` | Recurring Deposit | `inst_no` × `inst_amount` (default = months; `period_dd` must be 0) | `trans_rd_schedule`, one per month | Same |
| `3` | Fixed Deposit | 1 × `inst_amount` | none | Principal + interest |
| `4` | Reinvestment Deposit | 1 × `inst_amount` | none | Compound (quarterly when the scheme type is not compound) |
| `5` | Monthly Income Scheme | 1 × `inst_amount` | `trans_mis_payout`, one per payout period | Principal (interest is paid out) |

