## 4. DepositAccountAdd

```
POST /api/DepositAccountAdd
```

Account fields (same as savings):

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `appl_date` | date | Yes | Not in the future |
| `scheme_id` | int | Yes | Active TD scheme of the chosen product type |
| `cust_type_cd` | int | Yes | `1` Group, `2` Individual |
| `cust_id_primary` | int | Yes | Group id or member id |
| `op_mode_cd` | int | Yes | Group 9 |
| `prod_type_cd` | int | No (recommended) | Group 6; checked against the scheme |
| `deposit_type_cd` | int | No | `2`; defaults to the scheme's type |
| `appl_no`, `special_catg_cd`, `cust_id_joint1`, `cust_id_joint2`, `holder_name`, `nom_regd`, `fo_id`, `branch_id` | | No | As for savings |
| `status_cd` | int | No | `1` Active (default) or `7` KYC Pending |
| `td` | object | **Yes** | TD details, below |

`td` block:

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `period_yy` / `period_mm` / `period_dd` | int | At least one > 0 | 0–50 / 0–120 / 0–120. Recurring: `period_dd` must be 0 |
| `inst_amount` | decimal | Yes | > 0. Principal (FD / Reinvestment / MIS) or installment amount (Daily / RD) |
| `start_date` | date | No | Default `appl_date` |
| `inst_no` | int | No | Daily / RD only; default = term days / months |
| `roi` | decimal | No | 0 – 100; default slab / scheme rate |
| `account_no` | int | No | 1 – 32767; default next number |
| `ref_ac_no` | string | No | Max 15, unique |
| `matu_ins_cd` | int | No | Group 13 |
| `sbcredit_ac_id` | int | For `matu_ins_cd = 4` | Open savings account of the same customer |
| `tds_deduct` | bool | No | Default `false` |
| `collect_deposit` | bool | No | `true` posts `inst_amount` as the first deposit now |
| `payment_mode_cd` | int | No | Group 41 for that deposit: `1` Cash (default), `2` Bank Cheque, `3` Bank Transfer |
| `remarks` | string | No | Max 250; stored on that deposit |

