## 11. TermDepositPayoutPay

Pays one MIS payout and posts its Payment voucher.

```
POST /api/TermDepositPayoutPay
```

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `payout_id` | int | Yes | Payout |
| `paid_date` | date | No | Default today; not before the due date, not in the future |
| `payment_mode_cd` | int | No | Group 41: `1` Cash (default), `2` Bank Cheque, `3` Bank Transfer |

```json
{ "payout_id": 16, "payment_mode_cd": 1 }
```

### Success `200`

Returns the payout (same shape as the list item) plus `voucher_note`:

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "MIS payout of 509.59 paid (Cash)",
  "data": {
    "payout_id": 16,
    "account_id": 25,
    "due_date": "2026-11-09",
    "due_amount": 509.59,
    "paid_date": "2026-11-09",
    "voucher_id": 90,
    "voucher_no": "JV-2026-00005",
    "paid_by": 1,
    "paid_by_name": "admin",
    "paid_at": "2026-11-09 11:02:41",
    "status_cd": 1,
    "status_desc": "Paid",
    "is_payable": false,
    "voucher_note": null,
    "...": "other payout fields"
  }
}
```

| HTTP | Message |
|------|---------|
| `404` | *MIS payout not found* |
| `422` | *MIS payout is already paid on 09-11-2026* |
| `422` | *Payout is not due until 09-11-2026* |
| `422` | *Pay the earlier payout due on 09-11-2026 first* |
| `422` | *The deposit amount has not been received yet for this account* |
| `422` | *MIS payout cannot be paid on a closed deposit account* / *… not allowed on an account with status Freezed* |
| `422` | *Branch day is not open for the paid date …* / *Paid date is outside the active financial year* / *Backdated payouts are not allowed* |
| `422` | *Payment mode must be 1 (Cash), 2 (Bank Cheque) or 3 (Bank Transfer)* |

